flowchart TD
  S[Confirmed submission] --> V{Published snapshot and approved scoring policy?}
  V -->|No| STOP[Block and report missing approval]
  V -->|Yes| LOCK[Lock attempt in transaction]
  LOCK --> A[Load immutable answers and question revisions]
  A --> C[Apply approved scoring weights and rounding]
  C --> R[Persist overall and competency results]
  R --> M[Match approved versioned recommendation rules]
  M --> COMMIT[Commit once and return stable result]
